.DS_Store

# Desk Health Coach — per-viewer schedule/limitation/goal/behavior data and absolute-path
# runtime state. The engine itself (desk-health/runtime/*.sh, *.js) and the seed catalogs stay
# tracked and shared unchanged; only the paths below are ever viewer-specific or run-generated.
desk-health/.staging/
desk-health/config/
desk-health/data/
desk-health/state/
desk-health/runtime/tick.log
desk-health/runtime/*.log
desk-health/runtime/mode
desk-health/dashboard.html
desk-health/coach-summary.json
desk-health/installed-files.txt
